 "intro_zh": "虎头旅游景区具有大界江、大湿地、大冰雪、大森林等塞北自然风光、战争遗址和历史文物等旅游资源，是集生态旅游、红色旅游、森林旅游、跨境旅游、冰雪旅游为一体的综合性景区，被专家称为黑龙江省唯一一处“非城市中心型旅游资源集合区”。",
 "intro_en": "Hutou tourist attraction has tourist resources such as the Great Jiejiang River, the Great Wetland, the Great Ice and Snow, the Great Forest, and other natural scenery in northern Saibei, war sites and historical relics. It is a comprehensive scenic spot integrating eco-tourism, red tourism, forest tourism, cross-border tourism, and ice and snow tourism. It is called by experts the only \"non-city central tourist resource collection area\" in Heilongjiang Province.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
